    "target_type": "DTNGT2",
    "canonical_name": "DT Next Generation Target, Version 2",
    "notes": "How this model is addressed on an OpenQualia measurement host, so that a serial alone is enough to fetch a unit's own measurement. Both spellings were verified against targets.digitaltransitions.com by a fetch. The host matches values without regard to case or whitespace but not to dashes, and its API spellings can differ from its web addresses, so these are recorded rather than derived."
